<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 25.8850 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 25.8850 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate rose two basis points to 25.8850 percent Wednesday from 25.8650 percent Tuesday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>TIIP rose 6.60 basis points to 25.8447 percent Wednesday from 25.7787 percent the week before.</p>
<p>TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is replacing TIIP, an average interbank rate.</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558))</p>
</text>
